  "notes": [
    "The same registers answer to functions 03 and 04.",
    "Modbus RTU uses 8 data bits, 1 stop bit and no parity; the speed is set in the web page (factory 9600 bit/s). The factory Modbus address is 254.",
    "FLOAT and DWORD values have the high word first.",
    "The 32-bit alarm word is at registers 100 and 101; the bits listed are all in register 101.",
    "Days of a schedule: bit 7 is Monday, bit 1 Sunday and bit 0 holidays.",
    "The functions available depend on the model (appendix A of the manual).",
    "The clear commands at 450 to 452 follow the order of the manual: energy, cooling and heating, pulses.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
